	(text "MUX36S08 Input Multiplexer\n\nChannel Assignments:\n  S1 (Addr 0): Vx - Unknown input (+/-5V)\n  S2 (Addr 1): GND - Zero calibration\n  S3 (Addr 2): VrefRaw - Pre-filter ADR1001 avg\n  S4 (Addr 3): Spare1\n  S5 (Addr 4): Spare2\n  S6 (Addr 5): Range20V (4:1 divider)\n  S7 (Addr 6): Range100V (20:1 divider)\n  S8 (Addr 7): Range500V (100:1 divider)\n\nTeensy Control Pins:\n  A0=Pin5, A1=Pin6, A2=Pin7, EN=Pin8"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 38.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001")
	)
	(text "Caddock 1776-C441 Pinout (Figure 8/11)\n\nResistor chain: Pin1--[R1]--Pin2--[R2]--Pin3--[R3]--Pin4--[R4]--Pin5--[R5]--Pin6/7\n\n  Pin 1: R1 input (HV in)\n  Pin 2: R1 out (tap after 10M)\n  Pin 3: R2 out (tap after 1.111M)\n  Pin 4: R3 out (tap after 101K)\n  Pin 5: R4 out (tap after 10K)\n  Pin 6: R5 out (tap after 1K)\n  Pin 7: Common (GND ref)\n\nDivider Configurations:\n  +/-20V (4:1):   Out=Pin2, Rs=2.11M\n  +/-100V (20:1): Out=Pin3, Rs=473K\n  +/-500V (100:1): Out=Pin3, Rs=0 (direct GND)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 139.7 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002")
	)
